{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Wick 旋转”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Wick旋转"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>使用虚时间实现 "},{"Local":{"url":"Minkowski时空","text":"Minkowski 时空"}},{"Plain":"与欧氏空间之间的转换.</p>\n<p>引入复旋转可产生场方程的解 (?)</p>\n"}]}}